zation in the row includes multiple possible teaching subjects."},{"type":"h","text":"Science Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in teaching:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physics concepts"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Biology"},{"text":"Scientific reasoning"},{"text":"Experiments"},{"text":"Laboratory activities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to teach:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arithmetic"},{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Mathematical reasoning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Studies Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Civics"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Social science inquiry"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Language Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar instruction"},{"text":"Reading"},{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Speaking"},{"text":"Listening"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Business studies"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Financial literacy"},{"text":"The exact subject combination depends on the candidate's prior academic subjects and institutional rules."}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Teaching Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student moves from theory toward classroom application."},{"type":"h","text":"Lesson planning"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong lesson plan includes:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learning Objective","Prior Knowledge","Introduction","Concept Explanation","Activity / Example","Student Practice","Assessment","Feedback","Homework / Extension"]},{"type":"h","text":"Teaching methods"},{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn to use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lecture"},{"text":"Discussion"},{"text":"