","text":"Differentiated teaching"},{"type":"flow","items":["Same Learning Goal","Different Learning Paths","Different Activities","Different Support","Common Assessment Objective"]}]},{"heading":"Digital Teaching Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern teacher should be comfortable with educational technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Digital whiteboards"},{"text":"Learning Management Systems"},{"text":"Online assessment platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Interactive presentation tools"},{"text":"Quiz platforms"},{"text":"Video-editing basics"},{"text":"Screen recording"},{"text":"Digital worksheet creation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted lesson planning"},{"text":"AI-generated formative assessments"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"Digital content creation"},{"text":"Adaptive learning systems"},{"text":"AI output should be reviewed for factual accuracy, age appropriateness, bias and curriculum alignment before being used with students."}]}]},{"heading":"Subject-Specific Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Science Teacher"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Virtual laboratories"},{"text":"Simulations"},{"text":"Digital microscopes"},{"text":"Interactive diagrams"},{"text":"Data-logging tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics Teacher"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GeoGebra"},{"text":"Graphing tools"},{"text":"Spreadsheet models"},{"text":"Mathematical simulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Studies Teacher"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital maps"},{"text":"GIS demonstrations"},{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Language Teacher"},{